\par\par \b \uc2  UPDATE 1-IMF says Europe's outlook good, praises ECB. \b0\par\par\uc2  By Mark Egan \par \uc2 826 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 9 November 2000\par 18:49\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  WASHINGTON, Nov 9 (Reuters) - As the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  again wades in to try and salvage the sinking euro, the IMF Fund said on Thursday the ECB-led concerted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in September was well-judged and that the "misalignment" of the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  compared to the U.S. dollar would eventually correct. \par \par \uc2  In an upbeat annual assessment of the economic and monetary policies of the 11-nation euro area, the International Monetary Fund said Europe should use its improving outlook to address structural problems and ensure long-term growth. \par \par \uc2  "Directors agreed that the September concerted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in support of the euro had helped in stabilizing the exchange rate by sending a signal that market participants will have to bear in mind in the future," the IMF said in its report, which was completed on Oct. 16. \par \par \uc2  The IMF said "the misalignment of the euro both vis-a-vis the U.S. dollar and in effective terms remains large. Directors considered that this misalignment should eventually correct." \par \par \uc2  Along with many European officials, the Washington-based global lender has repeatedly stated it believes the troubled unified \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which has slid steadily in value since its introduction in January 1999, is heavily undervalued. \par \par \uc2  The IMF report said the euro was undervalued by as much as 30 percent versus the dollar and by between 10-20 percent in general. It gave no time frame for such an appreciation, which it said would bring medium-term equilibrium. \par \par \uc2  RATES APPROPRIATELY CAUTIOUS \par \par \uc2  The assessment said the ECB's monetary policy of raising interest rates had been "appropriately cautious". However, should circumstances reverse and cost pressures dissipate or reverse and inflation shows signs of declining, "Interest rates should be adjusted appropriately", the IMF added. \par \par \uc2  There report held few surprises after expansive comments on Europe by IMF Managing Director Horst Koehler, who spoke earlier this week in support of the ECB. \par \par \uc2  "The report is very supportive of what the ECB's monetary policy has been," IMF European Department Director Michael Deppler told reporters at a news briefing. \par \par \uc2  "Basically we believe the ECB has done a good job in managing a rather difficult situation faced with a weak euro and higher oil prices," he said. "In our view, \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  is an important part of policy instruments of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 ." \par \par \uc2  On Thursday, the ECB led a fresh round of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  among European central banks. The move marked the third such \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in less than two weeks. \par \par \uc2  While declining to comment on specific acts of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Deppler indicated the IMF broadly supported the ECB \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , even in the absence of help from the \b \highlight22\uc2 United States\b0 \highlight\uc2  and Japan. \par \par \uc2  "It is our point of view that it is very important to commit and to give credibility to the commitment ... and what better way to express your commitment than to put your money on the line," he said. \par \par \uc2  The staff report accompanying the IMF board assessment cut growth forecasts for the area to 3.4 percent this year and 3.2 percent in 2001. Those were down from previous staff estimates of 3.5 percent and 3.4 percent respectively, mainly to reflect the impact of the weaker euro and higher oil prices. \par \par \uc2  The reduced growth expectations were largely expected after the IMF lowered its projections for German growth last week, saying the reduced estimates reflected weaker overall growth expectations for Europe. \par \par \uc2  Also as a result of higher oil prices, the staff forecast inflation of 2.3 percent this year and 2.1 percent in 2001, up from earlier expectations of 2.1 percent and 1.7 percent. \par \par \uc2  OIL PRICES A RISK \par \par \uc2  The report warned "The persistence of higher oil and volatile oil prices has heightened downside risks and might affect the otherwise favorable prospects for growth in the short run." \par \par \uc2  Given the higher oil prices, the fund said it would be wise for the ECB to focus more on "core" inflation rates which exclude volatile food and energy prices, rather than being overly concerned about headline inflation. \par \par \uc2  Also, in light of higher oil prices, the fund said ensuring that wage moderation continued was essential to keeping the current economic expansion on track. \par \par \uc2  The report again urged Europe to press ahead with vital reforms, in particular to address labor-market rigidities, which are seen as contributing heavily to Europe's higher unemployment rate versus that of the United States. \par \par \uc2  Deppler said the long-term challenge for Europe was to run budget surpluses while times are good by using spending cuts to offset targeted tax cuts. That would avoid the need to increase taxes later when the economic climate worsens. \par \par \uc2  Deppler was particularly critical of the euro area's nominal three percent limit on fiscal deficits, saying "Europe needs to shift from this historic perspective they have had on nominal deficits." \par \par \uc2  The report also called on Europe to tackle the more restrictive and complex aspects of its trade regime. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dwb908vem\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
