\par\par \b \uc2  Euro below 87 cents in new post- \highlight22\uc2 intervention \highlight\uc2  low. \b0\par\par\uc2 226 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Oktober 2000\par 16:29\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2000 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  NEW YORK, Oct 5 (Reuters) - The euro fell below 87 cents in early U.S. trade on Thursday, its lowest level since Sept. 22, when the Group of Seven industrial nations launched a concerted \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prop up the ailing \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  The euro traded as low as 86.97 cents, according to Reuters data, down half a percent from the previous day's U.S. close. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was still comfortably above its record lows hit two days before the \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  near 84.40 cents, a decline of 28 percent from its launch levels in January 1999. \par \par \uc2  Analysts say the market is testing central banks' resolve to defend the single \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "The market is still negative on the euro and wants to challenge the central banks and see what the next level is where they will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Ben Strauss, trader at Bank Julius Baer in New York. \par \par \uc2  The fall comes on the heels of a surprise quarter of a percentage point interest rate hike by the European \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  (ECB) which initially boosted the euro. \par \par \uc2  In a press conference following the rate hike, ECB President Wim Duisenberg warned that all G7 members, including the \b \highlight22\uc2 United States\b0 \highlight\uc2 , may cooperate on more \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  if needed. Group members are the \b \highlight22\uc2 United States\b0 \highlight\uc2 , Japan, Germany, France, Britain, Italy and Canada. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020010821dwa505ckh\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
